<title>MALAYSIA: AMMB Holdings segment year results.</title>
<headline>AMMB Holdings segment year results.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p> Segment			 Turnover	     Pre-tax profit</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	 1997	1996</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Merchant banking     1,139.15    728.68	300.83    221.60</p>
<p> Commercial banking     597.64    266.83	 80.10     30.06</p>
<p> Finance		  1,537.48  1,134.74	380.68    280.17</p>
<p> Credit, leasing	  259.60    199.07	 60.10     45.66</p>
<p> Stock,sharebroking     273.27    123.18	191.14     73.35</p>
<p> Insurance		  163.38    111.85	  6.63	0.08</p>
<p> Offshore banking	  80.75     21.95	 17.28	3.77</p>
<p> Unit trust management    6.14	6.50	  1.87	3.04</p>
<p> Others	    profit  66.48     44.64   loss 9.31 loss 5.51</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
